          "snippet": {
            "line": 1416,
            "text": "theorem massHistory_of_composition (u : EvenProfile S) (g : Field) {R eta : ℝ}\n    (hR : 0 ≤ R) (hg : ContinuousOn (fun X => g (X, eta)) (Icc 0 (R ^ 2 / 2)))\n    (hu : ∀ r ∈ Icc 0 R, u (r, eta) = g (r ^ 2 / 2, eta)) :\n    PositiveOrderMoments.massHistory u (R, eta) = ProfileHistories.primitive g (R ^ 2 / 2, eta)"
          }
